{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back to Zero</strong> is a challenging pixel-art platformer in the spirit of \u201cFoddian\u201d classics where every jump counts, and one mistake can send you plummeting all the way back to the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken deep in a mysterious underground cave with one goal: <strong>escape</strong>. There are <strong>no checkpoints</strong> and no mercy. Climb, leap, and fail your way through a vertical gauntlet of punishing terrain and narrow gaps. Every fall is a lesson, and every climb is a triumph.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Precision platforming</strong> with tight, responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Charming pixel art</strong> visuals in a cave world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Fall-to-fail gameplay</strong> with zero checkpoints and infinite retries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Unlockable <strong>power-ups</strong> that shift your movement dynamics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Speedrun-friendly with a timer for players who dare to perfect their climb</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842940?t=1766433704","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842940/c4140d888afca793b70f3601594c37d53566a16f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766433704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842940/d0d31a455c1f061aa4b62700cf7393b5d45a9df8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766433704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842940/d0d31a455c1f061aa4b62700cf7393b5d45a9df8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766433704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"